### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### Get all jobs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/jobs

### Get job by ID (Existing)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/3

### Get job by ID (Deleted - Test Exception Handling)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/2

### Create a new job
POST http://localhost:8080/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Amazon",
  "jobTitle": "Java Full Stack Developer",
  "status": "Applied",
  "applicationDate": "2026-07-31"
}

### Update job application
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Amazon",
  "jobTitle": "Senior Java Full Stack Developer",
  "status": "Interview Scheduled",
  "applicationDate": "2026-07-31"
}

### Delete job application
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/2